  <div class="awsdocs-note"><div class="awsdocs-note-title"><awsui-icon name="status-info" variant="link"></awsui-icon><h6>Note</h6></div><div class="awsdocs-note-text"><p>On <code class="code">bedrock-mantle</code>, both APIs use the <code class="code">/openai/v1</code> base path, not <code class="code">/v1</code>. Use either API with this model:</p><div class="itemizedlist">
     
     
   <ul class="itemizedlist"><li class="listitem"><p>For Responses, use <code class="code">/openai/v1/responses</code>.</p></li><li class="listitem"><p>For Chat Completions, use <code class="code">/openai/v1/chat/completions</code>.</p></li></ul></div></div></div>
  
  <h2 id="model-card-openai-gpt-6-1-sol-capabilities">Capabilities and Features</h2>
  <p><b><u>Bedrock Features</u></b></p>
  <p><b>Features supported using <code class="code">bedrock-runtime</code></b></p>
  <div class="table-container"><div class="table-contents"><table id="w637aac11c30c10b9b7"><thead>
     <tr><th><b>Supported</b></th><th><b>Not Supported</b></th></tr>
    </thead>
     <tr>
      <td style="vertical-align: top;" tabindex="-1">
